Files derived from actions/scaleset
-----------------------------------

Each carries a header naming its upstream path and its changes.

  - internal/runner/adapter.go: the listener handler shape (the three
    listener.Scaler methods and the fields they log) is adapted from
    examples/dockerscaleset/scaler.go. It is the only adapted file; the rest
    of the pool, including its runner bookkeeping, is this repository's own.
  - internal/fakeactions/server.go: copied, with the changes its header lists,
    from internal/testserver/server.go. It is used by the tests only.

